    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... friends and doctors are all gone or they don't understand. they just want to keep patching me up so I can keep existing in this state. but what's the point? i'm just waiting for something to finally break. it feels more like a burden to everyone else than it does to me. like i'm just a ghost in this house.",
