      "content": "i've had enough of \"talking\" about it. i'm just tired of the endless cycle of being poked and prodded just to stay alive for another month of this. there's no dignity in just waiting for my heart to give out or for some accident to happen. i wish i could just... decide when the clock stops. it feels like the only way to actually have some control left.",
